1
00:01:31,991 --> 00:01:34,092
Hearing rumors that a witch...

2
00:01:34,756 --> 00:01:37,989
...who kidnaps children and drinks their
blood lives in the woods outside town...

3
00:01:38,749 --> 00:01:41,038
...Mokku ventured into the
forest out of morbid curiosity.

4
00:01:43,424 --> 00:01:47,160
There, he met the gentle-looking
Countess Leonard.

5
00:01:49,540 --> 00:01:53,107
Unaware she was a vampire
in disguise Mokku...

6
00:01:53,545 --> 00:01:56,120
...even fawned over her and
begged her to be his mama.

7
00:01:59,071 --> 00:02:01,526
Starving for the fresh blood of children...

8
00:02:01,909 --> 00:02:04,920
...the vampire ordered Mokku to return
to town and bring back a friend.

9
00:02:06,505 --> 00:02:08,026
Without suspecting a thing...

10
00:02:08,534 --> 00:02:11,449
...Mokku set off for town
to invite his girlfriends.

11
00:02:24,830 --> 00:02:25,830
Mokku...

12
00:02:52,990 --> 00:02:55,451
Mokku is already dead.

13
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:57,468
He can't possibly come back.

14
00:03:17,766 --> 00:03:18,766
Mokku?

15
00:03:20,737 --> 00:03:21,737
Mokku!

16
00:03:23,113 --> 00:03:24,861
You're back!

17
00:03:26,364 --> 00:03:29,160
I'm so glad you came back safe and sound!

18
00:03:31,884 --> 00:03:33,819
What is it? What's the matter?

19
00:03:36,590 --> 00:03:39,060
Cheer up! You're a boy, aren't you!

20
00:03:39,147 --> 00:03:43,088
Hey, look at that! You're back, you're
back! Thank goodness, thank goodness!

21
00:03:43,940 --> 00:03:45,757
Grandpa is so happy.

22
00:03:46,961 --> 00:03:48,492
Thank goodness, thank goodness.

23
00:03:48,780 --> 00:03:50,160
I'm sorry, Grandpa.

24
00:03:50,780 --> 00:03:52,615
No, no, no... It's all right,
it's all right.

25
00:03:53,820 --> 00:03:56,499
Thank goodness, thank goodness.
Grandpa is so happy.

26
00:03:56,523 --> 00:03:59,030
Grandpa is so happy.
Thank goodness, thank goodness.

27
00:04:00,380 --> 00:04:02,020
I really am so glad.

28
00:04:03,765 --> 00:04:06,145
What's wrong, Mokku? What's the matter?

29
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:14,070
Mokku, won't you dance with me?
Come on, come on, let's dance, let's dance!

30
00:04:14,149 --> 00:04:16,360
Thank goodness, thank goodness!
Grandpa is so happy.

31
00:04:16,573 --> 00:04:20,500
Look, Mokku, won't you dance?
Thank goodness, thank goodness.

32
00:04:21,524 --> 00:04:25,980
Truly, thank goodness! Grandpa is so
happy. Thank goodness, thank goodness.

33
00:04:30,202 --> 00:04:32,482
Mokku, stay with me!

34
00:04:33,110 --> 00:04:34,968
I want to sleep...

35
00:04:36,270 --> 00:04:39,999
There, there. You must be exhausted.
Let's get some sleep, let's go to sleep.

36
00:04:46,030 --> 00:04:50,568
Poor thing, suffering so
much to end up like this...

37
00:05:02,700 --> 00:05:04,795
Come on, get some rest.

38
00:05:06,319 --> 00:05:07,720
I'll sleep beside you.

39
00:05:51,359 --> 00:05:57,220
Please, Mokku. I'm counting on you.
Bring back a good child, all right?

40
00:06:13,070 --> 00:06:14,800
Ready yet?

41
00:06:15,470 --> 00:06:17,237
Not yet.

42
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,960
Ready yet?

43
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,860
Ready!

44
00:06:22,301 --> 00:06:23,356
Oh my!

45
00:06:28,266 --> 00:06:29,660
Get out of my way!

46
00:06:29,971 --> 00:06:31,176
Want to go to a castle?

47
00:06:31,586 --> 00:06:32,586
A castle?

48
00:06:32,895 --> 00:06:35,158
The Countess said we could come.

49
00:06:35,471 --> 00:06:37,578
It's a wonderful place.

50
00:06:38,105 --> 00:06:41,189
I've never heard of a castle around here.

51
00:06:41,615 --> 00:06:43,217
I'm the only one who knows.

52
00:06:49,700 --> 00:06:51,700
I can take you with me if you want.

53
00:06:52,020 --> 00:06:54,980
If you want to play,
wait there and I'll let you in.

54
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,540
Ready yet?

55
00:06:58,385 --> 00:07:00,390
Ready.

56
00:07:01,180 --> 00:07:05,156
It's true. I made a promise
to Countess Leonard.

57
00:07:06,249 --> 00:07:07,004
What?

58
00:07:07,105 --> 00:07:08,917
That I'd bring you all.

59
00:07:09,261 --> 00:07:11,289
You're my friends, aren't you?

60
00:07:11,835 --> 00:07:14,123
Please, come with me.

61
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:36,444
Mokku, what's wrong?

62
00:07:43,317 --> 00:07:45,170
Something's wrong...

63
00:07:46,447 --> 00:07:48,465
It's nothing. Come on, everyone, let's go!

64
00:08:07,730 --> 00:08:10,682
It's a promise. Take it off here.

65
00:08:10,914 --> 00:08:13,818
Why do we have to take off our crosses?

66
00:08:14,100 --> 00:08:17,370
Because there are no schools
or churches at the castle.

67
00:08:17,675 --> 00:08:19,423
We won't need anything like that.

68
00:08:20,250 --> 00:08:21,908
That's strange...

69
00:08:22,065 --> 00:08:23,893
You're the strange ones.

70
00:08:23,917 --> 00:08:27,300
What's the point of wearing something
like that? It's completely useless.

71
00:08:27,700 --> 00:08:32,105
Talk like that is how Lino and Marco
got killed by wolves!

72
00:08:32,525 --> 00:08:36,769
Heh, damn it!
I made it back, didn't I? Look!

73
00:08:38,819 --> 00:08:43,879
There's no helping it. If we don't go,
Mokku will break his promise.

74
00:08:59,779 --> 00:09:00,779
Let's go!

75
00:09:23,495 --> 00:09:25,120


76
00:09:48,089 --> 00:09:49,323
Good.

77
00:09:50,641 --> 00:09:51,641
Go back!

78
00:10:09,504 --> 00:10:13,820
Someone clearly saw your Mokku
taking those kids away!

79
00:10:14,910 --> 00:10:17,018
Old man, what are you
going to do about this?!

80
00:10:17,569 --> 00:10:21,320
That place is terrifying—even grown men
only dare go as far as the edge of the forest!

81
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:24,580
The woods are deep, and they say
it's crawling with starving wolves!

82
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:28,280
It's all your fault for making
a wooden puppet like that!

83
00:10:30,005 --> 00:10:31,854
I am truly sorry...

84
00:10:32,534 --> 00:10:34,458
An apology won't fix this!

85
00:10:35,008 --> 00:10:37,294
What are you going to do about my child?!

86
00:10:37,855 --> 00:10:40,605
Bring Rosanna back here right now!

87
00:10:40,965 --> 00:10:42,861
Even if you say that...

88
00:10:42,885 --> 00:10:45,040
If Sophia dies like Lino and Marco did...

89
00:10:45,609 --> 00:10:47,260
...you'll pay for this!

90
00:10:47,796 --> 00:10:50,205
All I can do is...

91
00:10:51,245 --> 00:10:54,900
...find another oak tree
and carve a puppet...

92
00:10:55,105 --> 00:10:57,980
...but I can never make another
puppet like Mokku again.

93
00:10:58,980 --> 00:11:01,600
You've got to be joking!
An evil puppet like that...

94
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:05,673
Listen to me. If Anna and the
others don't come back safely...

95
00:11:05,697 --> 00:11:08,200
...you're getting kicked
out of this village!

96
00:11:32,275 --> 00:11:35,620
Mokku, what have you done?

97
00:11:35,900 --> 00:11:37,880
What am I supposed to do?

98
00:11:38,530 --> 00:11:40,637
Mokku really is a bad boy.

99
00:11:40,944 --> 00:11:42,806
Making Grandfather suffer like this.

100
00:11:48,389 --> 00:11:48,994
Huh?

101
00:11:49,432 --> 00:11:52,040
What is Grandfather planning to do?

102
00:12:04,089 --> 00:12:06,838
Grandfather! You can't go into
Devil's Forest alone!

103
00:12:46,279 --> 00:12:48,022
Now then, come to my room.

104
00:12:48,234 --> 00:12:49,280
Yes!

105
00:12:57,529 --> 00:13:01,160
Mokku, starting tonight,
you'll sleep in Rufus's room.

106
00:13:01,909 --> 00:13:03,946
Mama, but why...

107
00:13:06,350 --> 00:13:08,836
You said you'd be my mama!

108
00:13:13,432 --> 00:13:18,732
The Countess only sleeps
with human children.

109
00:13:29,179 --> 00:13:31,420
Where did Rufus go?

110
00:13:32,231 --> 00:13:35,686
I really don't want to sleep
all alone in a room like this.

111
00:13:39,119 --> 00:13:41,660
Rufus went to suck the
blood of horses and cows...

112
00:13:42,145 --> 00:13:45,320
...and Countess Leonard
went to suck Anna's blood.

113
00:13:45,939 --> 00:13:49,502
Who's there?! Come out!
You won't get away with lying to me!

114
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:53,060
Mokku, have you forgotten my voice?

115
00:13:54,619 --> 00:13:56,320
The Oak Tree Fairy...

116
00:14:05,445 --> 00:14:08,940
Leonard really is 521 years old.

117
00:14:10,045 --> 00:14:11,690
You heard it yourself, didn't you?

118
00:14:14,483 --> 00:14:18,034
Leonard stays alive by drinking the blood
of living human children.

119
00:14:18,595 --> 00:14:23,420
That's not true! She loves children,
and she said she'd be my mama!

120
00:14:23,965 --> 00:14:25,578
Grandfather is worried sick.

121
00:14:25,860 --> 00:14:27,800
Hurry and save Anna and the others.

122
00:14:28,810 --> 00:14:30,880
But Anna and the others
came on their own...

123
00:14:32,849 --> 00:14:34,453
You brought Anna and the others here...

124
00:14:34,477 --> 00:14:36,664
...just so you could live an
easy life playing around.

125
00:14:38,315 --> 00:14:43,156
That's not true! I love studying, and I love
going to church and listening to sermons!

126
00:14:47,709 --> 00:14:49,770
My nose... My nose is growing!

127
00:14:50,122 --> 00:14:54,128
Whenever you lie in front of me,
your nose will only keep growing longer.

128
00:14:54,539 --> 00:14:58,445
No, I hate this! Please do something!

129
00:14:59,430 --> 00:15:01,520
I look ridiculous with a nose like this!

130
00:15:01,755 --> 00:15:04,739
What is truly shameful is your ugly heart.

131
00:15:07,019 --> 00:15:13,100
You may not yet have a righteous or
kind heart, but you surely have courage.

132
00:15:13,539 --> 00:15:17,940
Now, if you understand what I have said,
go to Madame Leonard's room.

133
00:15:18,480 --> 00:15:20,380
And then you must save Anna and the others.

134
00:15:27,895 --> 00:15:33,813
<i>Mokku, only by overcoming hardship and
suffering can you become a real human.</i>

135
00:15:34,415 --> 00:15:39,060
<i>I pray that day comes as soon as possible.</i>

136
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:46,896
To preserve this beautiful body forever...

137
00:15:47,396 --> 00:15:50,760
...I will keep drinking the blood
of sweet children like you.

138
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:56,820
A being as beautiful as I
has earned that right.

139
00:15:57,572 --> 00:15:59,820
I'll keep using that lazy Mokku...

140
00:16:00,294 --> 00:16:02,680
...to bring me lovely children like you...

141
00:16:02,879 --> 00:16:04,980
...and drain every drop of your blood.

142
00:16:10,011 --> 00:16:13,367
First, I'll take Anna's blood.

143
00:16:21,560 --> 00:16:24,000
The other two can cower and watch.

144
00:16:37,829 --> 00:16:39,020
That damn vampire.

145
00:16:51,629 --> 00:16:54,240
Sophia and Rosanna were
turned into little people.

146
00:16:56,489 --> 00:16:58,128
It's not my fault!

147
00:17:03,509 --> 00:17:05,434
There was nothing I could do!

148
00:17:05,552 --> 00:17:08,627
I've become the vampire's henchman!

149
00:17:28,409 --> 00:17:30,320
<i>I'm so sad.</i>

150
00:17:30,769 --> 00:17:33,000
<i>I hate vampires!</i>

151
00:17:36,829 --> 00:17:38,835
What's going to happen to me now?

152
00:17:51,080 --> 00:17:52,080
Mokku!

153
00:17:53,944 --> 00:17:54,959
Mokku!

154
00:17:56,152 --> 00:17:58,522
What's wrong? Mokku,
pull yourself together!

155
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:02,920
I'm here now, so you have nothing to fear.

156
00:18:03,539 --> 00:18:07,361
Grandpa, I'm the vampire's minion.

157
00:18:07,493 --> 00:18:09,607
What are you talking about, Mokku?

158
00:18:10,539 --> 00:18:13,940
You are no vampire. You're Grandpa's child.

159
00:18:46,369 --> 00:18:47,710
It's a miracle!

160
00:19:14,180 --> 00:19:15,740
We did it!

161
00:19:15,800 --> 00:19:17,580
Mokku, it's all right now!

162
00:19:18,600 --> 00:19:24,020
Y-You're... l-little people...

163
00:19:25,209 --> 00:19:26,641
What happened to me?

164
00:19:27,349 --> 00:19:32,020
We were children just like you
who hated school and church.

165
00:19:32,655 --> 00:19:34,259
You can talk!

166
00:19:34,479 --> 00:19:37,058
She turned us into little people
so we couldn't escape...

167
00:19:37,082 --> 00:19:39,640
...and she kept sucking
our blood until we died.

168
00:19:40,453 --> 00:19:41,906
How horrible!

169
00:19:41,956 --> 00:19:44,620
But we have the cross now,
so we'll be all right!

170
00:19:46,610 --> 00:19:48,184
It won't be that easy.

171
00:19:48,594 --> 00:19:52,520
You old fool, how dare you barge in here.

172
00:19:53,927 --> 00:19:54,927
The cross!

173
00:19:55,313 --> 00:20:00,694
I was never human to begin with,
so that useless thing won't work on me!

174
00:20:02,354 --> 00:20:03,715
I'll bite you to death!

175
00:20:10,800 --> 00:20:13,187
Fire! Fire is her weakness!

176
00:20:22,263 --> 00:20:23,310
All right.

177
00:20:32,649 --> 00:20:34,019
Ah, Mokku!

178
00:20:35,309 --> 00:20:38,176
Mokku! If you do that, your hands will...

179
00:20:39,020 --> 00:20:40,020
I'll be all right!

180
00:20:40,114 --> 00:20:41,900
My hands can be fixed!

181
00:20:43,309 --> 00:20:45,820
You bastard, you damn wooden puppet!

182
00:20:47,904 --> 00:20:51,329
Damn you! Damn you!

183
00:21:35,079 --> 00:21:37,600
I... I'm sorry, Anna.

184
00:21:39,244 --> 00:21:40,680
Rosanna and Sophia!

185
00:21:41,461 --> 00:21:42,461
Everyone, hurry!

186
00:21:42,938 --> 00:21:43,618
Over here!

187
00:21:43,780 --> 00:21:44,780
All right!

188
00:21:50,909 --> 00:21:55,036
Please help me! The cross...
the cross is coming!

189
00:21:55,584 --> 00:21:58,600
Please, not the cross...

190
00:22:40,546 --> 00:22:42,491
It's the power of God...

191
00:22:56,292 --> 00:22:57,292
Mokku!

192
00:23:13,059 --> 00:23:15,837
The Devil dwells within the human heart.

193
00:23:16,267 --> 00:23:20,180
If there is no Devil in your heart,
vampires cannot exist.

194
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:22,000
Oh?

195
00:23:24,976 --> 00:23:26,976
Wait!

196
00:23:27,835 --> 00:23:29,835
Wait! Hey—!

197
00:23:33,054 --> 00:23:36,200
<i>Having overcome the
terrifying Devil's magic...</i>

198
00:23:36,586 --> 00:23:38,563
<i>Mokku vows to become a good boy.</i>

199
00:23:39,353 --> 00:23:43,392
<i>But, aboard the sleigh
bound for the Paradise of Play...</i>

200
00:23:43,595 --> 00:23:45,680
<i>...that vow was already
gone from his heart.</i>

201
00:23:47,126 --> 00:23:49,923
<i>A paradise where one can
live just playing day after day.</i>

202
00:23:50,486 --> 00:23:53,962
<i>It was a land of sweet temptation
created by the Poppy Fairy...</i>

203
00:23:54,228 --> 00:23:57,400
<i>...who seeks to steal Mokku
away from the Oak Tree Fairy.</i>

204
00:23:58,479 --> 00:24:01,040
<i>Look forward to next week's
Kashi no Ki Mokku.</i>

